    mentorPriority: ['Located in the Milky Way bulge in Sagittarius', 'Looks like a globular cluster but has multiple ages and iron abundances', 'Four stellar generations in the 2026 Webb/Hubble result', 'Contains an exceptional millisecond-pulsar population', 'Fastest known pulsar PSR J1748−2446ad spins at 716 Hz'],
